{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21017","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21017-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21017-0","text":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21017-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21017-1","text":"「嗨——嗨——！观众老爷们，这里的信号畅通吗？」\n\n橙发少女兴奋地喊着，对着镜头笃悠悠举起锤子。\n「大家——见过少女胸口碎大石吗！」\n\n「我当云骑军可不是为了做这种事啊！」\n褐发少女眼冒金星，橙发少女狡黠一笑。\n「拜托啦——这也是助人为乐啊！」","speaker":""}]}
